order: 1
---

Install [Arcana](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/sc-final-adventure-arcana) on NeoForge **1.21.1**.

There is no extra guidebook. Press **L**. Open the **Arcana** tab. That tree is the pack.

You get an **Arcane Decree** when you join. Craft or find a **Bounty Board**, put the decree on it, take a contract. That is the first hour: one board, one contract, one reason to leave spawn.

Mod advancements (Apotheosis tiers, recipe unlocks) stay on because other mods need them. Follow the Arcana chapters when you want the story and the decree unlocks.

If the instance has [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar) and [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex), use those pages for the bar and the Codex. Arcana assumes you will live on that HUD once magic starts.
